                     "title":  "Dataset for publication \"Onboard carbon capture for circular marine fuels\"",
                     "doi":  "10.5281/zenodo.14882867",
                     "publication_date":  "2025-02-17",
                     "description":  "\u003cp\u003eDataset associated with the publication \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003e\"Onboard carbon capture for circular marine fuels\"\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e by Margarita A. Charalambous, Valentin Negri, Valentin Kamm, and Gonzalo Guill\u0026eacute;n-Gos\u0026aacute;lbez, published in the journal ACS Sustainable Chemistry and Engineering. \u003ca title=\"Onboard carbon capture for circular marine fuels\" href=\"https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acssuschemeng.4c08354\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eLink to publication\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe dataset includes all the codes, environmental databases, simulations, figures, and economic data. The codes and the excel data are required to reproduce the plots embedded in the main manuscript.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe dataset includes 3 Excel files. The content of each dataset is here elucidated:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eData.xlsx:\u003c/strong\u003e Inventory datasets used for the economic assessment. Includes the costs per tonne kilometer (tkm) for methanol and natural gas ships, and also the final data, including the sensitivity analysis used for plotting. \u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCircular-marine-fuels-2030.xlsx:\u003c/strong\u003e life cycle inventories used for 2030. Includes the production of CO2, H2, methanol, natural gas, and the transport inventories for the three ships (methanol, natural gas, BAU). This is an excel file database that can be directly used in Brightway, using Activity browser. The database was created using data from premise compatible with Ecoinvent v3.10.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCircular-marine-fuels-2050.xlsx: \u003c/strong\u003elife cycle inventories used for 2050. Includes the production of CO2, H2, methanol, natural gas, and the transport inventories for the three ships (methanol, natural gas, BAU). This is an excel file database that can be directly used in Brightway, using Activity browser. The database was created using data from premise compatible with Ecoinvent v3.10.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe dataset includes 2 python jupyter notebooks. The content of each dataset is here elucidated:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eenv_calc.ipynb: \u003c/strong\u003ePython code that shows how the calculation of the life cycle impact assessment is performed and how the results are plotted.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlotting.ipynb:\u003c/strong\u003e Python code that shows how to plot the economic results.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe dataset includes 4 process simulations. The content of each simulationis here elucidated:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMeOH_Production.hsc: \u003c/strong\u003eAspen HYSYS file that includes the process simulation of methanol production, using CO2 from ships and DAC.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCapture_onboard_methanol.hsc\u003c/strong\u003e: Aspen HYSYS file that includes the process simulation of capture onboard methanol ship.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCapture_onboard_NG.hsc: \u003c/strong\u003eAspen HYSYS file that includes the process simulation of capture onboard natural gas ship.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLNG_Production.apw:\u003c/strong\u003e Aspen PLUS file that includes the process simulation for natural gas production.\u003c/p\u003e",
